<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia confident of timely Bakun dam completion.</title>
<headline>Malaysia confident of timely Bakun dam completion.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad said on Wednesday he expects the $5.5 billion Bakun hydroelectric project to be completed on schedule in five years.</p>
<p>&quot;It should be finished in five years,&quot; Mahathir told reporters after the signing of the Bakun dam's engineering pact.</p>
</text>
